actions.supported_help = Ku rhekhoda swileriso swa nhlawulo leswi tiyisisiweke, maleyara lamantshwa/lamakhopi/rasterize/hlanganisa, ku tata muhlovo wa le mahlweni/endzhaku, Gaussian/Box/Motion Blur, Sharpen, Unsharp Mask, Median ni mindzulamiso.
